{"path":"text/text_encoding/environment_is","title":"std::text_encoding::environment_is","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::text_encoding::</span>environment_is","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/text/text_encoding/environment_is","section":"text","kind":"page","summary":"Checks whether the environment encoding is equal to the encoding whose MIBenum value is the specified value I. A call to this function is equivalent to return environment() == I;.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> id I <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> environment_is<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks whether the <a href=\"/w/cpp/text/text_encoding/environment\">environment encoding</a> is equal to the encoding whose MIBenum value is the specified value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">I</span></code>. A call to this function is equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> environment<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> I<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>This function is deleted unless the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/climits\"><span class=\"kw394\">CHAR_BIT</span></a></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">8</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> I\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>text_encoding::id</code> whose value to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">environment<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">I</span></code>; <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Template parameters","id":"Template_parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"text","title":"Text processing library"},{"path":"text/text_encoding","title":"std::text_encoding"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::text_encoding::environment_is","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++26. Checks whether the environment encoding is equal to the encoding whose MIBenum value is the specified value I."},{"label":"Template parameters","note":"I"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if environment() is equal to I; false otherwise."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":75,"codeBlockCount":0}
